cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its methods, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SecBrain: a trust-tier-aware, self-correcting knowledge-graph engine"
abstract: >-
  SecBrain anchors large volumes of noisy community text to authoritative ground truth in a
  bitemporal, trust-tiered knowledge graph; resolves conflicts with a temporal-first,
  source-trust-weighted cascade; and answers questions as measured estimates with confidence
  intervals and per-statistic provenance, abstaining when evidence is insufficient.
authors:
  - family-names: Mahmoudi
    given-names: Mahyar
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mahmoudimahyar/Second_Brain"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-21"
keywords:
  - knowledge graph
  - GraphRAG
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - entity resolution
  - truth discovery
  - conflict resolution
  - bitemporal data
  - Model Context Protocol
